<title>RUSSIA: Ukrainian President Kuchma in Moscow - Interfax.</title>
<headline>Ukrainian President Kuchma in Moscow - Interfax.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukrainian President Leonid Kuchma arrived in Moscow on Friday for an &quot;unofficial working visit&quot;, Russia's Interfax news agency said.</p>
<p>Quoting unidentified sources, it said he would meet Russian Prime Minister Viktor Chernomyrdin. Russian and Ukrainian officials in Moscow and Kiev could not be reached to confirm the report.</p>
